    "updated_at": "2022-01-12T15:25:00Z",
    "body": "just bisected this. introduced in v3.0.0 (beta.10 works fine) with this PR: https://github.com/node-fetch/node-fetch/pull/1064\r\n\r\n_added heap memory usage:_\r\n```js\r\nimport { Agent } from \"node:http\";\r\nimport { memoryUsage } from \"node:process\";\r\nimport fetch from \"node-fetch\";\r\n\r\nconst agent = new Agent({ keepAlive: true });\r\n\r\nfor (let i = 0; ; i++) {\r\n  const { status } = await fetch(\"http://example.com\", { agent });\r\n\r\n  if (i % 100 === 0) console.log(i, memoryUsage().heapUsed, status);\r\n}\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
